<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-16T02:54:43.692Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:54:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have seized control of the Bab al-Mandeb strait and surrounding positions after Yemeni government troops withdrew, allowing the rebels to dominate the key maritime chokepoint. The Houthis also repelled Saudi-led coalition missile and drone attacks and killed a senior Yemeni military commander in Al-Jawf. Japan's ONE shipping group transited the Red Sea choke point for the first time in three years, showing limited commercial traffic despite the fighting. A Houthi missile strike killed five people at a checkpoint near Aden. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261115-yemen-houthis-advance-to-within-60-kilometres-of-aden-military-sources-say&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/16/houthis-advance-in-yemen-as-government-forces-move-to-defend-aden?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOaklLcW9Zb1lsUnppSlhoNXRJek44OXFLdWlCY1Y5SkJRZGtMc3JUR2ZjSWJ6SUZxTzVkU0ItWEVSaklDRElOMExNTkNIUGFzWHN5ZkdKSnQ2eXlheDlXOW92Qll2clpYdXZQTnBtUUFkVzViZUx4eDNHUTRsdlJ3RGotamtfM1gxLURTZFc0dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/15/world/middleeast/saudi-houthis-yemen-red-sea.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOZ2NSdXVjeDlTU0lLeTAtMGs5RmdHaW0wTVhVbzUwempOYUdlNVB3NXprMGZqYksyVjhLUU1OV250QlczemJOT2tXcVFIZEJYb0dwblVCblExbnFmZkVyeGZnZ0NJY3Z3a3NTcmxUQ21tR0ZsQVdhTTNRNWJaZW5pOEk4RDNEMXN3aExOaEE0QVNzaXV3UTM3ZjlNa2hDenRtajR2aGVGT3RQR0NOSnY1VH